skill.core.luck.description.advanced:
{Advanced Luck}

Advanced Luck increases your hero's luck by 2.

It also gives the Preserve creature an additional 20% health points.

skill.core.luck.description.basic:
{Basic Luck}

Basic Luck increases your hero's luck by 1.

It also gives the Preserve creature an additional 10% health points.

skill.core.luck.description.expert:
{Expert Luck}

Expert Luck increases your hero's luck by 3.

It also gives the Preserve creature an additional 20% health points and 10% damage.
